scope one unrun falsifier of the parent paper settled on its own terms, and the question underneath it measured on real code
status GREEN -- paper B+ 88 at Field, register 77; tracked_link green after staging; ASCII clean on all three files; no code changed, so no module witness applies
recommend keep-going -- all three falsifiers of 20260905-232224 are now run and the parent paper wants its own addendum naming what survived: the joule bound is weaker than claimed and the say-why gap at existing decision sites is stronger, which is a rewrite of the parent's own thesis rather than a fourth paper
